  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The median O'Neil ship is around 10km, the largest ships by far are the sister ships Nix and Hydra, made from two of pluto's moons, and around 100km in length. They're sub-light intersteller ships used for generating biomass in flight to help terraform the worlds in the Alpha Centauri system.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205655\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.001 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.001 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1549-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205655 and revision id 3648. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
